-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:28px;line-height:34px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.6px;color:#1C1917;\">Your Flow-Like code</h1><p class=\"fl-muted\" style=\"margin:10px 0 0 0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:400;color:#78716C;\">Enter this code in Flow-Like to continue.</p></td></tr><tr><td height=\"4\" style=\"height:4px;line-height:4px;font-size:4px;\">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class=\"fl-pad\" style=\"padding:6px 40px 28px 40px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tr><td class=\"fl-tint\" bgcolor=\"#FFF1EA\" style=\"background-color:#FFF1EA;border:1px solid #FFDCCB;border-radius:14px;padding:22px 16px 22px 26px;\"><p class=\"fl-ink fl-code-text\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:36px;line-height:44px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:10px;color:#1C1917;text-align:center;\">{####}</p></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\"fl-pad\" style=\"padding:0 40px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tr><td class=\"fl-rule\" style=\"border-top:1px solid #E7E5E4;font-size:0;line-height:0;height:20px;\">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\"fl-pad\" style=\"padding:0px 40px 12px 40px;\"><p class=\"fl-muted\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;font-weight:400;color:#78716C;\">It confirms this email address, or lets you choose a new password, and works only for a short time.</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"fl-pad\" style=\"padding:0px 40px 12px 40px;\"><p class=\"fl-muted\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:-ap